ci-failure.prompt:
CI run ({{ workflow }}) failed on branch {{ branch }}.

Run URL: {{ run_url }}
Commit: {{ head_sha }}

Please run `gh run view {{ run_id }} --log-failed` to diagnose the error (following `wlrec-diagnose`) and prepare a fix.

ci-success.prompt:
Remote CI ({{ workflow }}) has passed on branch {{ branch }}.

Run URL: {{ run_url }}

Please check PR checks status (`gh pr checks`) and verify if it is ready to merge.

review-bot.prompt:
Received review comments from {{ sender }} on PR #{{ pr_number }} ({{ pr_url }}):

State: {{ review_state }}
Details:
{{ review_body }}

Please evaluate these comments critically via `wlrec-review` (`[FIX] / [DISMISS] / [ASK]`): fix real bugs, and refute hallucinations/false positives.
